* 25 Oct 26 Windows port - files-admin is "built" now: the group sdfilesadmin, files-admin-on / -off and the server side came with Linux ef9d594 (RELEASE_1.1 178).
* 25 Oct 26 Windows port - from Linux 04f1eaa - the toolkit base and tool.keys (S.75 TK-0.1 to TK-1).  Two differences: "Windows user" for "Linux user", and
